189
00:12:51,290 --> 00:12:52,040
可是将军 我们-
But general, we-

190
00:12:52,081 --> 00:12:53,581
明白 长官
We understand, sir.

191
00:13:12,915 --> 00:13:13,415
啥?
Huh?

192
00:13:22,081 --> 00:13:23,706
啧 我们走
Tch, let's go.

193
00:13:33,165 --> 00:13:34,540
啊这
Uh, that was-

194
00:13:34,581 --> 00:13:36,206
非常可疑对吧?
Very suspicious?

195
00:13:50,206 --> 00:13:51,873
你们来是不来?
You coming or what?

196
00:13:54,998 --> 00:13:56,456
都准备h
All ready to-

197
00:13:56,540 --> 00:13:57,956
她情况很不妙
She's in bad shape.

198
00:13:58,873 --> 00:14:00,498
我们要把她带到安全的地方
We need to get her somewhere safe.

199
00:14:12,331 --> 00:14:14,873
我真的非常抱歉
I'm so, so sorry.

200
00:14:20,665 --> 00:14:23,956
我该走了 对吗?
It is time for me to go, isn't it?

201
00:14:25,123 --> 00:14:29,456
我们很快就会再见面的 我保证
We'll see each other again really soon. I promise.

202
00:14:51,165 --> 00:14:52,206
干得不错
Good work.

203
00:14:52,456 --> 00:14:55,206
嗤 抓到Penny才叫干得不错
Tch, good work would've been capturing Penny.

204
00:14:55,790 --> 00:14:57,665
嘛 常言有道
Well, you know what they say.

205
00:14:58,415 --> 00:15:00,040
如果无法击败敌人的话
If you can't beat them,

206
00:15:01,331 --> 00:15:03,706
就让他们归顺你吧
then make them join you.